text+='\nCoverage: Benchmark has zero Go blocks beyond StringEquality and 386 C segment lines beyond it. ReleasePaths has 21 Go blocks and 264 C segment lines beyond IteratorResultShape. The latter includes counted release and slab allocation; benchmarks include maps, records and bulk allocator reuse. Exact lists and raw Go/C profiles are preserved.\n\nPlaces the brief was unclear or cost time, and owner findings:\n\n'+'\n'.join('- '+s for s in issues)+'\n\nTiming: warm setup 0 seconds; npm reports 418 milliseconds; nproc 5. Completed coverage command walls '+str(round(sum(x['wall'] for x in coverage),3))+' seconds, plus the failed cold 120-second outer compilation. Bounded matrix/control command walls '+str(round(sum(x['wall'] for x in matrix),3))+' seconds. Binary timings are in matrix.json; cold runtime rebuilds are included, not separately phase-timed. Whole-package baseline 90.054 seconds. Session approximately 25 minutes.\n'
